{"sha": "6a50a0f27f5e423fa358824b46b9557585f1d942b7edf23561f1f0a3631fd123", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, line join=round]", "  % one SiO4 tetrahedron in perspective", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\coordinate (t) at (0,1.2); \\coordinate (a) at (-1.0,-0.5);", "    \\coordinate (b) at (1.0,-0.5); \\coordinate (c) at (0.25,0.05);", "    \\draw[thick, omDef] (t) -- (a) -- (b) -- cycle; \\draw[thick, omDef] (t) -- (b);", "    \\draw[dashed, omDef] (a) -- (c) -- (b) (t) -- (c);", "    \\foreach \\p in {t,a,b,c} \\shade[ball color=red!60] (\\p) circle (0.16);", "    \\shade[ball color=gray!40] (0.06,0.18) circle (0.11);", "    \\node at (0,-1.2) {\\ce{SiO4^4-}：单个四面体};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % a chain of tetrahedra seen from above", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=3.6cm]", "    \\foreach \\i in {0,1,2,3} {", "      \\draw[thick, omDef, fill=omDef!10] (\\i*1.1,0) -- (\\i*1.1+0.55,0.95) -- (\\i*1.1+1.1,0) -- cycle;", "      \\shade[ball color=red!60] (\\i*1.1+0.55,0.95) circle (0.12);", "      \\shade[ball color=red!60] (\\i*1.1+0.55,0.32) circle (0.10);", "    }", "    \\foreach \\i in {0,1,2,3,4} \\shade[ball color=red!60] (\\i*1.1,0) circle (0.12);", "    \\node[align=center] at (2.2,-1.0) {链状 $(\\ce{SiO3})_n^{2n-}$：每个四面体\\\\ 共用两个顶点（从上方看）};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 硅酸盐单元：孤立的 \\ce{SiO4} 四面体（硅为灰色，", "氧为红色），以及一条链，其中每个四面体与相邻者共用两个氧", "原子。层状（三个共用顶点）构成云母和", "黏土；骨架（四个共用顶点）构成石英。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[惰性电子对效应]\\label{def:b1:p-block-13-15:inert-pair}", "\\emph{惰性电子对效应}\\index{惰性电子对效应}是指沿第 13 至 15 族向下，", "比该族最高氧化态低两个单位的氧化态稳定性递增：", "例如铊（I）比铊（III）稳定，铅（II）比铅（IV）稳定，铋（III）比铋（V）稳定。", "重元素的 \\textit{ns}$^2$ 电子对束缚很紧，", "较少参与成键。", "\\end{definition}", "", "该效应解释了为什么二氧化铅是一种强氧化剂", "（$E^\\circ(\\ce{PbO2}/\\ce{Pb^2+}) = 1.46$~V，见\\cref{ch:b1:nernst}），而", "碳（IV）和硅（IV）则是它们各自元素的稳定氧化态。", "", "\\section{第 15 族：氮}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[氮的阶梯]\\label{prop:b1:p-block-13-15:nitrogen-ladder}", "氮取遍 $-3$ 到 $+5$ 之间的每个氧化数：\\ce{NH3} 和", "\\ce{NH4+}（$-$III）、\\ce{N2H4}（$-$II）、\\ce{NH2OH}（$-$I）、\\ce{N2}（0）、", "\\ce{N2O}（$+$I）、\\ce{NO}（$+$II）、\\ce{HNO2} 和 \\ce{NO2-}（$+$III）、", "\\ce{NO2}（$+$IV）、\\ce{HNO3} 和 \\ce{NO3-}（$+$V）。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对每个化学式应用\\cref{prop:b1:nernst:on-rules}中的规则，取 H 为", "$+$I，O 为 $-$II：在 \\ce{N2H4} 中 $2x + 4 = 0$；在 \\ce{NO2-} 中 $x - 4 =", "-1$；依此类推。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[固氮]\\label{def:b1:p-block-13-15:nitrogen-fixation}", "\\emph{固氮}\\index{固氮}是指任何能把空气中的", "氮气转化为可供生物或工业利用的化合物（氨、硝酸盐）的过程：", "细菌的生物固氮、", "闪电固氮和氨的工业合成。", "\\end{definition}", "", "哈伯--博施法使氮气与氢气在铁", "催化剂上化合，即 \\ce{N2 + 3H2 <=> 2NH3}。该反应在室温下热力学上有利", "（\\qty{25}{\\celsius} 时 $K = 10^{5.8}$，由氨的生成吉布斯自由能算得），", "但反应太慢；催化剂只有在高温下才起作用，而", "兼顾速率与产率的温度与压强的选择，", "在本科二年级分册中确定。氨随后", "通过奥斯特瓦尔德法氧化为硝酸。", "% ledger: dfg:NH3_g", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}, box/.style={draw, rounded corners, fill=omDef!8, align=center, minimum height=0.9cm}]", "  \\node[box] (air) at (0,0) {空气\\\\\\ce{N2}};", "  \\node[box] (gas) at (0,-1.6) {天然气\\\\\\ce{H2}};", "  \\node[box] (hb) at (3.4,-0.8) {哈伯--博施法\\\\铁催化剂};", "  \\node[box] (ox1) at (7.3,-0.8) {铂铑网\\\\\\ce{NH3} $\\to$ \\ce{NO}};", "  \\node[box] (ox2) at (11.0,-0.8) {氧化\\\\吸收\\\\\\ce{NO} $\\to$ \\ce{NO2} $\\to$ \\ce{HNO3}};", "  \\draw[->, thick] (air) -- (hb);", "  \\draw[->, thick] (gas) -- (hb);", "  \\draw[->, thick] (hb) -- node[above] {\\ce{NH3}} (ox1);", "  \\draw[->, thick] (ox1) -- node[above] {\\ce{NO}} (ox2);", "  \\draw[->, thick] (ox2.south) -- ++(0,-0.6) node[below] {\\ce{HNO3}};", "  \\draw[->, thick] (hb.south) -- ++(0,-0.9) node[below] {\\ce{NH3}（化肥）};", "  \\draw[->, thick] (ox2.north) -- ++(0,0.5) -| node[pos=0.25, above] {\\ce{NO} 循环利用} (ox1.north);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 从空气到硝酸：合成氨，随后是奥斯特瓦尔德法的", "三个步骤。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[配平串联工业反应方程式]\\label{met:b1:p-block-13-15:ostwald-balance}", "=\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 逐步配平：（1）\\ce{4NH3 + 5O2 -> 4NO + 6H2O};", "        （2）\\ce{2NO + O2 -> 2NO2}；（3）\\ce{3NO2 + H2O -> 2HNO3 + NO}。", "  \\item 将各步乘以适当系数，使生成的每种反应中间体都被消耗", "        （第 3 步生成的 \\ce{NO} 返回第 2 步）。", "  \\item 相加：若 NO 完全循环利用，总方程式为", "        \\ce{NH3 + 2O2 -> HNO3 + H2O}，即每个氨对应一分子硝酸。", "  \\item 质量衡算用总方程式，", "        各反应器的设计用各步反应。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{history}[弗里茨·哈伯]", "=\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.18\\linewidth}\\vspace{0pt}", "=\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book2/haber.jpg}", "=\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "=\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.78\\linewidth}\\vspace{0pt}", "弗里茨·哈伯证明，氨可在压强下借助催化剂由氮气与氢气合成；", "卡尔·博施则将实验室反应变为工业过程。", "哈伯获得 1918 年诺贝尔化学奖。", "同一个人还主持了氯气作为武器的首次大规模使用，", "发生在第一次世界大战中：养活半个人类的化学，", "与致人死亡的化学之间，只隔着化学家的选择。", "（照片：The Nobel Foundation，1919 年发表，公有领域，", "Wikimedia Commons。）", "=\\end{minipage}", "=\\end{history}", ""]}